><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>If this case is complex under rule 3.400 et seq. of the California Rules of Court, or a collections case under rule 3.740, you must serve a copy of this cover sheet on all other parties to the action or proceeding.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="text-decoration:none"
>(Cal. Rules of Court, rule 3.220.)</span
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></p
></body
