><draw name="column1" w="61.399mm" h="185.216mm" y="25.093mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Auto Tort</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Auto (22)‚ÄìPersonal Injury/Property Damage/Wrongful Death</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Uninsured Motorist<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(if the case involves an uninsured motorist claim subject to arbitration, check this item instead of Auto)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>(46)<span style="font-style:italic"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
></p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Asbestos</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Asbestos (04)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Asbestos Property Damage</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Asbestos Personal Injury/Wrongful Death</p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other PI/PD/WD (Personal Injury/</p
><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Property Damage/Wrongful Death) Tort</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Product Liability<span style="font-style:italic"
> (not asbestos or environmental/toxic tort)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>(24)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Medical Malpractice (45)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Medical Malpractice‚ÄìPhysicians &amp; Surgeons</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Professional Health Care Malpractice</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other PI/PD/WD (23)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Premises Liability (e.g., slip and fall)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Intentional Bodily Injury/PD/WD (e.g., assault, vandalism)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Intentional Infliction of Emotional Distress</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other PI/PD/WD</p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Non-PI/PD/WD (Other) Tort</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Business Tort/Unfair Business Practice (07)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Civil Rights (e.g., discrimination, false arrest)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not civil harassment)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>(08)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Defamation (e.g., slander, libel) (13)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Fraud<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(other than contract)</span
> (16)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Intellectual Property (19)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Professional Negligence (25)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Legal Malpractice</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Professional Malpractice<br
/><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not medical)</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Non-PI/PD/WD Tort (35)</p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Employment</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Wrongful Termination (36)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Employment (15)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
><br
/></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
/></ui
><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt"
/><font size="8pt" typeface="Arial" baselineShift="0pt" weight="bold"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="column2[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw name="column2" w="61.399mm" h="206.411mm" x="64.551mm" y="25.093mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Contract</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Breach of Contract/Warranty (06)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Breach of Rental/Lease Contract<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not unlawful detainer or wrongful eviction)</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Contract/Warranty Breach‚ÄìSeller Plaintiff<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not fraud)</span
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Negligent Breach of Contract/Warranty</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Breach of Contract/Warranty<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Song-Beverly Act: Motor Vehicle Lemon Law<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(check this item if the case involves a Song-Beverly Act claim regarding a motor vehicle)</span
> (49)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Rule 3.740 Collections<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(as defined in Cal. Rules of Court, rule 3.740(a))</span
> (09)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Collections (e.g., money owed, open book accounts, promissory note) (09)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Insurance Coverage<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not provisionally complex)</span
> (18)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Auto Subrogation</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Coverage</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Contract (37)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Contractual Fraud</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Contract Dispute</p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Real Property</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Eminent Domain/Inverse Condemnation (14)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Wrongful Eviction (33)<br
/>Other Real Property (e.g., quiet title) (26)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Writ of Possession of Real Property</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Mortgage Foreclosure<br
/>Quiet Title<br
/>Other Real Property<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not unlawful detainer)</span
></p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Unlawful Detainer</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Commercial (31)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Residential (32)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Drugs<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(if the case involves illegal drugs, check this item; otherwise, choose Commercial or Residential)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>(38)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Judicial Review</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Asset Forfeiture (05)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Petition re Arbitration Award (11)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Writ of Mandate (02)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Writ‚ÄìAdministrative Mandamus</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Writ‚ÄìMandamus on Limited Court Case Matter</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Writ‚ÄìOther Limited Court Case Review</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Judicial Review (39)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Review of Health Officer Order<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
>Notice of Appeal‚ÄìLabor Commissioner Appeals</p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"
