>Confession of Judgment<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(non-domestic relations)</span
></p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
>Sister-State Judgment</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
>Administrative Agency Award</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
>Petition/Certification of Entry of Judgment on Unpaid Taxes</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Enforcement of Judgment Case</p
><p style="margin-top:6pt;letter-spacing:0in"
>Miscellaneous Civil Complaint</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
>RICO (27)</p
><p style="margin-left:9pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
>Other Complaint<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>(not<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
><span style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0em"
>specified above</span
><span style="font-style:italic"
>)<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>(42)</p
><p style="margin-left:25.2pt;text-indent:-14.4pt;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"
